      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَدَثِّرٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَّثِّرٌ</span> <i>Wrapped in a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِثَار</span>; <i>wearing a</i>
